CN:STR_LUAUI_25HALLOWEENMAIN_RULE_2:
1. Enter the dungeon to uncover its hidden secrets;
2. Collect puppet souls and Soulthreads during exploration;
3. Use Soulthreads in Puppet Home to train puppets and get rewards;
4. Each training grants 50 Terror Points;
5. Accumulate Terror Points for stage rewards and compete on the local/regional/global ranking;
6. Boss Battle: Defeat the boss within 5 rounds for an S-Rating;
7. Stage Exploration: Collect all chests and soul artifacts, trigger all special events (Special events have a chance to trigger; not all may trigger in a single exploration), and clear the stage for 100%% exploration;
8. Accumulate enough S-Ratings or 100%% exploration to claim rich exploration rewards in the achievement interface.

